# The built dashboard. The live one is published to GitHub Pages by the daily
# workflow and never committed; a local `refresh.sh` writes this copy for iCloud.
# A tracked copy went stale within days and read as the current plan to anyone
# who opened it from the repo.
plan.html
site/

